      "The aimed-shot exception found during initial review is now accurately reflected: a manual idle hipfire start resets the combo, while the aimed projectile action has keep_combo_on_start=true and preserves the prior count before its projectile action increments it; from a reset count this is 0 to 1. The updated README, source index, RAW comparison rule, and variant page agree with fixed-source lines 319-331 and ActionHandler combo logic.",
