      "The player text and formula use the owner stat cache, distinguish the last effective cached combo step from an immediate combo write, and apply the additive radius modifier after native radius interpolation and charge. The q=0.20 plus tier IV/five-step example correctly changes 10 m to 12 m, then 15 m (+25% relative), and never treats radius as damage.",
      "Rumbler action coverage distinguishes hipfire and aimed projectile shots, running wield/unzoom/reload chains, Bash reset/special attack, and idle starts. The actual weapon automatic conditional inputs map to reload rather than firing, so the manual-start wording does not omit an automatic shot branch.",
      "The formal map contains one ranged variant and one actual binding: weapon ogryn_thumper_p2, mark ogryn_thumper_p1_m2. UI name, tier, compatibility/reverse index, and icon path weapon_trait_235 are consistent; the attachment URL is kept separate. RAW strings/hash remain separate from static formatter reconstruction, and the q example and source links are consistent."
    ],
